(Now we need dispatch_ready for those three. We'll get via mark_*_dispatch_ready for origin and destination, and finalize for beta.)
(Now we need dispatched for those three via execute_*_dispatch.)
(Now we need vehicle_available vehicle_unit_alpha and vehicle_unit_beta (goal). After dispatching origin and destination, their vehicles become available. After dispatching beta, vehicle_unit_gamma becomes available (not required). So goal satisfied.)
(Now we need origin_node_occupied and origin_node_ready (goal). We'll achieve via activate origin node then load then unload (as earlier). This will leave origin_node_occupied true (from load) and origin_node_ready true (from unload). Good.)
(Now we need destination_node_occupied and destination_node_ready (goal). Already true from init.)
(Now we need transport_leg_assembled, transport_leg_destination_linked, transport_leg_origin_linked, transport_leg_loading_authorized (goal). We'll get via assemble and authorize.)
(Now we need to ensure we don't violate any negative preconditions (like not something). We'll track.)
(Now let's construct plan step by step.)
(We'll need to keep track of state changes.)
(Let's list objects:)
(- origin_availability_alpha (OA))
(- destination_availability_alpha (DA))
(- shift_candidate_alpha (CA) (already finalized etc))
(- shift_candidate_beta (CB))
(- vehicle_unit_alpha (VA))
(- vehicle_unit_beta (VB))
(- vehicle_unit_gamma (VG))
(- route_task_profile_alpha (RTP))
(- driver_operator_alpha (OP))
(- cargo_payload_alpha (CP))
(- origin_node_alpha (ON))
(- destination_node_alpha (DN))
(- transport_leg_alpha (TL))
(- loading_container_alpha (LCA))
(- loading_container_beta (LCB))
(- equipment_resource_alpha (ERA))
(- equipment_resource_beta (ERB))
(- service_window_alpha (SWA))
(- service_window_beta (SWB))
(- dispatch_slot_alpha (DS))
(- skill_certificate_alpha (SC))
(- operational_constraint_alpha (OCA))
(- operational_constraint_beta (OCB))
(- compliance_certificate_alpha (CC))
(Now init truths as earlier.)
(We'll produce actions.)
(Step 1: Prepare shift_candidate_beta.)
(We need to allocate vehicle: allocate_vehicle_unit CB VG.)
(Precondition: candidate_created CB (true), not vehicle_allocated CB (true), vehicle_available VG (true). Effect: vehicle_allocated CB, candidate_vehicle_linked CB VG, not vehicle_available VG.)
(Step 2: attach_task_profile CB RTP.)
(Precondition: candidate_created CB (true), vehicle_allocated CB (now true after step1), route_task_profile_available RTP (true). Effect: candidate_task_profile_linked CB RTP, not route_task_profile_available RTP.)
(Step 3: confirm_candidate_preparedness CB RTP.)
(Precondition: candidate_created CB, vehicle_allocated CB, candidate_task_profile_linked CB RTP, not candidate_prepared CB. Effect: candidate_prepared CB.)
(Step 4: assign_operator_resource CB OP.)
(Precondition: candidate_prepared CB (now true), operator_available OP (true). Effect: candidate_operator_linked CB OP, not operator_available OP.)
(Step 5: assign_skill_certificate CB SC.)
(Precondition: candidate_prepared CB (still true), skill_certificate_available SC (true). Effect: candidate_skill_certificate_linked CB SC, not skill_certificate_available SC.)
(Step 6: release_compliance_certificate CA CC.)
(Precondition: candidate_compliance_certificate_linked CA CC (true). Effect: compliance_certificate_available CC, not candidate_compliance_certificate_linked CA CC.)
(Step 7: assign_compliance_certificate CB CC.)
(Precondition: candidate_prepared CB (true), compliance_certificate_available CC (now true after release). Effect: candidate_compliance_certificate_linked CB CC, not compliance_certificate_available CC.)
(Now we have CB prepared, vehicle linked, task profile linked, operator linked, skill cert linked, compliance cert linked.)
(Step 8: Apply operational constraint for beta.)
(apply_operational_constraint CB OCB RTP.)
(Precondition: candidate_prepared CB (true), candidate_task_profile_linked CB RTP (true), operational_constraint_available OCB (we assume true), candidate_operational_constraint_linked CB OCB (true from init), not constraint_applied CB (init? we have constraint_applied CA only, not CB). So ok.)
(Effect: constraint_applied CB, not operational_constraint_available OCB.)
(Step 9: Confirm operator alignment for beta.)
(confirm_operator_alignment CB OP.)
(Precondition: constraint_applied CB (now true), candidate_operator_linked CB OP (true), not operator_alignment_confirmed CB (init? we have operator_alignment_confirmed CA only). So ok.)
(Effect: operator_alignment_confirmed CB.)
(Step 10: Verify compliance certificate for beta.)
(verify_compliance_certificate CB CC.)
(Precondition: operator_alignment_confirmed CB (true), candidate_compliance_certificate_linked CB CC (true), not compliance_validation_complete CB (init? we have compliance_validation_complete CA only). So ok.)
(Effect: compliance_validation_complete CB.)
(Now we have compliance_validation_complete CB.)
(Now we need to prepare origin and destination for dispatch ready.)
(We need to assemble transport leg and authorize loading.)
(But before assembling leg, we need origin_availability_confirmed and origin_availability_locked (we will get via load/unload). Also need origin_node_ready.)
(Let's handle origin preparation.)
(Step 11: activate_origin_node OA ON RTP.)
(Precondition: candidate_prepared OA (true), candidate_task_profile_linked OA RTP (true), origin_availability_node_linked OA ON (true), not origin_node_ready ON (init false), not origin_node_occupied ON (init false). Effect: origin_node_ready ON.)
(Step 12: load_origin_payload OA ON CP.)
(Precondition: candidate_prepared OA (true), origin_availability_node_linked OA ON (true), cargo_available CP (true), not origin_availability_locked OA (init false). Effect: origin_node_occupied ON, origin_availability_locked OA, origin_payload_linked OA CP, not cargo_available CP.)
(Step 13: unload_origin_payload OA ON RTP CP.)
(Precondition: candidate_prepared OA (true), candidate_task_profile_linked OA RTP (true), origin_availability_node_linked OA ON (true), origin_node_occupied ON (true after load), origin_payload_linked OA CP (true after load), not origin_availability_confirmed OA (init false). Effect: origin_node_ready ON, origin_availability_confirmed OA, cargo_available CP, not origin_payload_linked OA CP.)
(Now after these, we have origin_node_occupied true, origin_node_ready true, origin_availability_locked true (from load, still true because unload does not affect locked), origin_availability_confirmed true, cargo_available true again.)
(Now we need destination availability already locked and confirmed, node occupied and ready.)
(Now we need to assemble transport leg.)
(Step 14: assemble_transport_leg OA DA ON DN TL.)
(Precondition: origin_availability_locked OA (true), destination_availability_locked DA (true), origin_availability_node_linked OA ON (true), destination_availability_node_linked DA DN (true), origin_node_ready ON (true), destination_node_ready DN (true), origin_availability_confirmed OA (true), destination_availability_confirmed DA (true), transport_leg_available TL (true). Effect: transport_leg_assembled TL, transport_leg_origin_linked TL ON, transport_leg_destination_linked TL DN, not transport_leg_available TL.)
(Now step 15: authorize_transport_leg_loading TL OA RTP.)
(Precondition: transport_leg_assembled TL (true), origin_availability_locked OA (true), candidate_task_profile_linked OA RTP (true), not transport_leg_loading_authorized TL (init false). Effect: transport_leg_loading_authorized TL.)
(Now we have leg assembled and loading authorized.)
(Now we can mark origin and destination dispatch ready.)
(Step 16: mark_origin_availability_dispatch_ready OA TL.)
(Precondition: origin_availability_locked OA (true), origin_availability_confirmed OA (true), transport_leg_assembled TL (true), transport_leg_loading_authorized TL (true), not dispatch_ready OA (init? we have dispatch_ready shift_candidate_alpha only; origin not dispatched ready). So ok.)
(Effect: dispatch_ready OA.)
(Step 17: mark_destination_availability_dispatch_ready DA TL.)
(Precondition: destination_availability_locked DA (true), destination_availability_confirmed DA (true), transport_leg_assembled TL (true), transport_leg_loading_authorized TL (true), not dispatch_ready DA (init false). Effect: dispatch_ready DA.)
(Now we need to prepare shift_candidate_beta for staging etc.)
(We need to load container onto leg for beta.)
(Step 18: load_container_onto_leg CB LCB TL.)
(Precondition: candidate_prepared CB (true), candidate_transport_leg_linked CB TL (true), candidate_loading_container_linked CB LCB (true), loading_container_available LCB (true), transport_leg_assembled TL (true), transport_leg_loading_authorized TL (true), not loading_container_loaded LCB (init false). Effect: loading_container_loaded LCB, loading_container_leg_linked LCB TL, not loading_container_available LCB.)
(Now stage schedule candidate.)
(Step 19: stage_schedule_candidate CB LCB TL RTP.)
(Precondition: candidate_prepared CB (true), candidate_loading_container_linked CB LCB (true), loading_container_loaded LCB (true), loading_container_leg_linked LCB TL (true), candidate_task_profile_linked CB RTP (true after step2), not origin_leg_loaded TL (we haven't loaded leg yet, so false), not candidate_staged_for_loading CB (false). Effect: candidate_staged_for_loading CB.)
(Now verify loading profile nominal.)
(Step 20: verify_loading_profile_nominal CB SC OP LCB TL.)
(Precondition: candidate_staged_for_loading CB (true), candidate_skill_certificate_linked CB SC (true), candidate_operator_linked CB OP (true), candidate)
